  "semisimplicity_proof": "Each N^3 block has square-free minimal polynomial: the only repeated characteristic factors are the two square-free degree-9 factors, and each has its full 27-dimensional eigenspace in every block. Hence N^3 is diagonalizable. rank(N)=rank(N^3)=234 rules out a nontrivial zero Jordan block; for nonzero eigenvalues the derivative of t^3 is nonzero. Therefore N is diagonalizable. Its g1 centralizer is the displayed commuting three-plane, the minimal dimension equal to the Vinberg rank, so it is a Cartan subspace.",
